; ---- TPDO5 - beyond the predefined connection set's 4 default slots.
; COB-ID is hand-assigned (0x690, from the same genuinely-unclaimed 4-bit
; function-code block used earlier this session for the live-reassignment
; test), NOT $NODEID-derived - this is the slot that actually forces
; COB-ID-based addressing, since it has no relationship to node-id at all.
